OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn estimated 15,000 properties across
OL,7,Ffive south London boroughs and two
OL,8,FSurrey boroughs may have no water or
OL,9,Flow pressure due to a burst water main,
OL,10,FThames Water has said.
OL,12,FThe company said the issue was
OL,13,Faffecting customers in postcode areas
OL,14,Facross Kingston upon Thames, Merton,
OL,15,FRichmond upon Thames, Sutton and
OL,16,FWandsworth in London, as well as
OL,17,FElmbridge and Spelthorne in Surrey.
OL,19,FThames Water apologised for the lack of
OL,20,Fwater, adding: "Our specialist team is
OL,21,Fnow on site and working to stop the
OL,22,Fwater flooding from the broken pipe."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
